  <item>
    <title>大学魅男，职场魅权，如何祛魅？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69aeb520275b0687043ec0e7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69aeb520275b0687043ec0e7</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Mar 2026 12:01:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>真高兴，在我进入中女时代的时候，“中女”已经有了新的叙事方式。</span></p><p><span>短暂的10年社会生活，我们经历的一个又一个“不过如此”的时刻见证着我们的成长。从处处想要证明自己的自卑，到自我认同高于他人评价的自信，这一路的每个故事都值得被看见。</span></p><p></p><p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span> 主播</span></strong></p><p><span>莎拉</span></p><p><span>💻</span><strong><span> 嘉宾</span></strong></p><p><span>刘阿姨</span></p><p><span>🎬</span><strong><span> 时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 祛魅，是对他人的仰视还是对自己的不认同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">01:47</a> 大学社团的角色，意外预设了如今在职场的定位</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a> 什么时候开始不再对“权威”深信不疑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">06:06</a> 2010年的大学，潜规则是只有男生可以当班长？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 上司出轨，击碎我的职业滤镜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> 在国外临时救场，出席行业论坛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> MAB谈判模拟课，原来你也怕！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a> 在职场，警惕同理心太强</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 先爱自己是对“付出”的祛魅</span></p><p><strong><span>== 祝你有机会获得无条件的关注和支持 ==</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/663393b6210fb7029dbf17ac/lr2cStLONTBA5W6CTb80Om9BGwm6.m4a" length="33573247" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiMnV_wAvV8eQcndC7Kb2oHhdHm1.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>平行世界的我：文理分科、高考、工作、情感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698dbf1a66e2c30377375219</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698dbf1a66e2c30377375219</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 12:00:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>🎙️ 主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>莎拉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💻 嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>clock_haha、亚瑟摩根</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎬 时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> 初印象，长大后你变了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a> “不打不相识”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> “暖男”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="359">05:59</a> 梦境解析：反复出现的高考场景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a> 高考失利，选择复读 or 专升本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 朋友圈，发 or 不发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 毕业十年后，工作和生活可以分开吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> 你找到奋斗一生的事业了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">20:57</a> 毕业选择：高薪教培行业 or 央企管培生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1394">23:14</a> 为什么选择考公务员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1471">24:31</a> 你是最爱自己的那个人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">28:47</a> 有过和自己不和解的阶段吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 十年后的理想生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1889">31:29</a> 歌曲纯享《大梦》</span></p><span></span><p><span>== </span><strong><span>祝你健康、勇敢、自由 </span></strong><span>==</span></p>]]></description>
