    <title>看浪姐，种草了心理暗示</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68302e37fcbc2e206b5f6042</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68302e37fcbc2e206b5f6042</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 May 2025 08:14:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「你的身体是否在替压力发声？」</span></p><p><span>「 冥想真的能重塑大脑吗？」</span></p><p><span>“</span><strong><span>你不是不健康，你只是太努力了”</span></strong><span>，心累不自知，身体先知道，大家身处焦虑和压力中，出现过生理反应吗？你是如何调节的呢？</span></p><p><span>都是针尖大的小事，但偏偏这种小事最扎人，</span><strong><span>职场隐形压力排行榜</span></strong><span>：</span></p><ul><li><p><span>职责边界模糊</span></p></li><li><p><span>同龄人之间的比较</span></p></li><li><p><span>职场冷暴力</span></p></li><li><p><span>领导PUA</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>🌟 本期主播</span></strong></p><p><span>莎拉、李游、兔子、云云、Eva</span></p><p><strong><span>📻 收听指南</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">00:02:22</a> 身体的智慧：压力过大时，它会比头脑更早报警</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">00:05:31</a> 社交媒体的困境：朋友圈秒删，谁没经历过自我审查</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">00:10:22</a> 隐形压力排行榜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="927">00:15:27</a> 奇葩领导图鉴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">0:22:32</a> 解压方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1732">00:28:52</a> 冥想的万能钥匙，一键切换状态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">00:35:42</a> 大脑的真相：它是工具，而非情绪的奴隶</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">00:38:25</a> 冥想健身房：五分钟感知幸福，屏蔽无用思维</span></p><p><strong><span>❤️ 联系我们</span></strong></p><p><span>听友群：添加微信好友 salad2014</span></p><p><span>公众号：莎拉有点闲</span></p><p><span>== 感谢收听，珍爱自己，关注自己 &nbsp;==</span></p>]]></description>
